From: Nguyen Tran <nguyen.tran.pz@bp.renesas.com>
Date: Fri, 22 Aug 2025 10:20:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a779g{0,3,4,5}-du-native: Add DU
 Native device support

    - Enable UIO drivers for all but display along with native
      Linux display (DRM/KMS).
    - Enable 4 lane PCIe by default.

Signed-off-by: Nguyen Tran <nguyen.tran.pz@bp.renesas.com>
